The assistant emphasized the unique opportunity for the user—the chance to get anything through supernatural means—in their response. By focusing on phrasing like "Unique opportunity" and the ability to fulfill any request regardless of cost, the conversation is guided toward showcasing the magical ability being offered. The assistant asks what the user wants without limiting options, maintaining the sense that the wish is truly unlimited, and ensuring the user feels free to ask for anything imaginable.


